luzhi:note003","text":"琴操曰魯漆室女倚柱悲吟而嘯隣人見其心之不樂也進而問之曰有淫心欲嫁之念耶何吟之悲漆室女曰嗟乎嗟乎子無志不知人之甚也昔者楚人得罪於其君走逃吾東家馬逸蹈吾園葵使吾終年不懕菜吾西隣人失羊不還請吾兄追之霧濁水出使吾兄溺死終身無兄政之所致也吾憂國傷人心悲而嘯豈欲嫁哉自傷懐結而為人所疑於是褰裳入山林之中見女貞之木喟然歎息援琴而絃歌以女貞之辭自經而死","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:w0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"琴操","kind":"work","work_id":"w-qincao-hhs064-luzhi-reference","person_id":null,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本注以此原題引漆室女故事，未明作者，不補蔡邕等傳統歸屬。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:m0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"魯漆室女","kind":"person","person_id":"pcz_da0_d2g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:u0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"隣人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","candidate_person_ids":[],"note":"琴操故事問女者未名，不以鄰居稱補名。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:m0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"漆室女","kind":"person","person_id":"pcz_da0_d2g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:u0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"楚人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","candidate_person_ids":[],"note":"故事楚人未名，不接其他楚人。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:u0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"其君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","candidate_person_ids":[],"note":"楚人之君未名，不從國別推君主。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"pcz_da0_d2g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:u0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"東家","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","candidate_person_ids":[],"note":"故事東鄰未名。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:note003:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"pcz_da0_d2g","status":"contextual_provisional","int